{"id":"2114372854649418181","post_id":"2114372854649418181","title":"GitHub - storytold/artcraft: ArtCraft is an intentional crafting engine for artists, designers, and filmmakers","source":"https://github.com/storytold/artcraft","html":"\n  \n    <p>The IDE for artists.</p>\n    <h3>artcraft-new-demo.mp4</h3>\n    <p>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzvQMdg66Go\">Watch the two-minute ArtCraft demo on YouTube</a>\n</p>\n    <p>\n  \n  <img>\n  <img>\n  <img>\n</p>\n    <p>\n  <a href=\"https://getartcraft.com/\">Download ArtCraft</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/storytold/artcraft/releases\">GitHub releases</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/_docs/dev_setup.md\">Build from source</a>\n</p>\n    <p>ArtCraft is the IDE for interactive AI image and video creation. Compose in 2D, stage scenes in 3D, and choose the models that fit your work. Turn prompting into crafting with visual tools for precise, repeatable results.</p>\n    <p>Artists need control over composition, character identity, and camera placement. Build the scene before you generate it. Click any preview to view it at full size.</p>\n    <table>\n      <tbody><tr>\n        <th>Feature</th>\n        <th>Preview</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr><td>Image to Location<p>Place virtual actors in a consistent environment and plan multiple shots in the same room.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/533582068-21f103e3-cc19-4882-a630-9caa1b76ae31.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzM1ODIwNjgtMjFmMTAzZTMtY2MxOS00ODgyLWE2MzAtOWNhYTFiNzZhZTMxLndlYnA_.ZE82eyCsmyeNJDgY6SQx-39esEDakB0wCFIPTsibc_k\" alt=\"Image to Location demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n      <tr><td>3D Image Compositing<p>Layer backdrops, foregrounds, and props in 3D to build compositions with depth.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/534173663-f93a616f-571d-474e-bcc0-53736de7303d.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzQxNzM2NjMtZjkzYTYxNmYtNTcxZC00NzRlLWJjYzAtNTM3MzZkZTczMDNkLndlYnA_.-sak8CD6GkcYpm2sBsxr-m4VPFgIxnv9Xew0sP9hmZw\" alt=\"3D Image Compositing demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n      <tr><td>2D Image Compositing<p>Compose a scene with image layers, background removal, and drawing tools.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/534174790-d6f99391-e496-4c62-9e37-29734ba5f899.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzQxNzQ3OTAtZDZmOTkzOTEtZTQ5Ni00YzYyLTllMzctMjk3MzRiYTVmODk5LndlYnA_.V9wed7XegzbkpxHzgzCxiEywfvCSeLqvZfSGyJukV3Q\" alt=\"2D Image Compositing demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n      <tr><td>Image to 3D Mesh<p>Turn an image into a 3D object you can position, rotate, and frame precisely.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/533587626-600a405c-e360-48c1-9b42-6e657ae6243b.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzM1ODc2MjYtNjAwYTQwNWMtZTM2MC00OGMxLTliNDItNmU2NTdhZTYyNDNiLndlYnA_.1c2J9J0cWi9q8cSsQXHGEk9aff-MObLa9H_CPHAgnnU\" alt=\"Image to 3D Mesh demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n      <tr><td>Character Posing<p>Pose characters and set your camera before generating the final shot.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/storytold/github-media/22a27373707b13f48fc56405f1f89ca143c43d5d/character-posing.webp\" alt=\"Character Posing demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n      <tr><td>Scene Blocking with Kitbashing<p>Combine 3D asset kits to control camera angles, object placement, and depth.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537505965-eef025ac-0346-4a46-a023-d48e23629eb5.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MDU5NjUtZWVmMDI1YWMtMDM0Ni00YTQ2LWEwMjMtZDQ4ZTIzNjI5ZWI1LndlYnA_.Cten-HZBTHWfZR_PpfR5yWuJprVloSHAUbyiZ8BXcxg\" alt=\"Scene Blocking with Kitbashing demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n      <tr><td>Character Identity Transfer<p>Use a posed mannequin to guide the placement and pose of your character.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537511944-629119ee-8c76-4a83-9827-8c6c995a3ec1.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MTE5NDQtNjI5MTE5ZWUtOGM3Ni00YTgzLTk4MjctOGM2Yzk5NWEzZWMxLndlYnA_.HDJ_VcD1bJD2UCaUKe8T71FMI7Y_dTqCQQYUdA6Ejq8\" alt=\"Character Identity Transfer demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n      <tr><td>Background Removal<p>Isolate subjects to use as props, layers, or backdrops in 2D and 3D scenes.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537520656-90c65057-5531-404f-83af-b34e66e24ec1.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MjA2NTYtOTBjNjUwNTctNTUzMS00MDRmLTgzYWYtYjM0ZTY2ZTI0ZWMxLndlYnA_.RpHPSNtGMN0xopb4mQYhLUSHjJjAo44TF2IgFhNOjoQ\" alt=\"Background Removal demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n      <tr><td>Mixed Asset Crafting<p>Combine image cutouts, worlds, and 3D meshes in one scene.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/storytold/github-media/main/ship-editing.gif\" alt=\"Mixed Asset Crafting demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n    <p>More previews are coming for scene blocking, canvas editing, and scene relighting.</p>\n    <p>Start with a prompt when you want to explore an idea quickly, then use the canvas and scene tools to refine it.</p>\n    <table>\n      <tbody><tr>\n        <th>Feature</th>\n        <th>Preview</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr><td>Text to Image<p>Explore ideas across a wide range of image models with a text prompt.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537514969-9cc289cd-faf4-4eaf-aed2-21134cce127c.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MTQ5NjktOWNjMjg5Y2QtZmFmNC00ZWFmLWFlZDItMjExMzRjY2UxMjdjLndlYnA_.PTZrf2uKzJ20hwdCi9KpU4hyVnjcg1HBGOjXxGROic4\" alt=\"Text to Image demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n      <tr><td>Prompted Image Editing<p>Describe changes to an image with models such as Nano Banana Pro and GPT Image.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537518478-a06fa6ad-936c-42d0-8767-48fdbb8ff141.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MTg0NzgtYTA2ZmE2YWQtOTM2Yy00MmQwLTg3NjctNDhmZGJiOGZmMTQxLndlYnA_.dvDR_YOpT_sSkUMkmuZJA837QB2RbUVHqTtyEft9xjQ\" alt=\"Prompted Image Editing demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n      <tr><td>Canvas Image Editing<p>Use drawing, masks, and inpainting to guide exactly where an image changes.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537516984-f036e08a-f3a6-417a-98ee-ec7f04b2b5ff.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MTY5ODQtZjAzNmUwOGEtZjNhNi00MTdhLTk4ZWUtZWM3ZjA0YjJiNWZmLndlYnA_.t2uXBC6RKbvG_qGbFRenkFMlco3Fi5TI4XXJIBwvqJg\" alt=\"Canvas Image Editing demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n      <tr><td>Image to Video<p>Animate an image with your choice of video models and generation controls.</p></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537515742-2bc6c592-511e-4fba-b40f-03c96699b7f7.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MTU3NDItMmJjNmM1OTItNTExZS00ZmJhLWI0MGYtMDNjOTY2OTliN2Y3LndlYnA_.aFQtP81vEMhKk1y0vJlsQK9YNvy5tKdi7WE9h9hbGe8\" alt=\"Image to Video demo\"></td>\n</tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n    <p>More previews are coming for image inpainting and image ingredients.</p>\n    <table>\n      <tbody><tr>\n        <th>Provider</th>\n        <th>Models and workflows</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>ArtCraft</td>\n        <td>Images, video, music and sound, 3D meshes, and worlds. Browse the complete model catalog below.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Grok</td>\n        <td>Grok Imagine and Grok Video.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Midjourney</td>\n        <td>Midjourney image generation.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Sora</td>\n        <td>Sora 1, Sora 2, and GPT Image 1.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>World Labs</td>\n        <td>Marble world generation with Gaussian splats.</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n    <h3>ArtCraft: the full 62-model catalog</h3>\n    <p>† Currently disabled. ‡ Restricted model; not currently available in the desktop app.</p>\n    <table>\n      <tbody><tr>\n        <th>Family</th>\n        <th>Models</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Nano Banana</td>\n        <td>Nano Banana; Nano Banana 2; Nano Banana Pro</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>GPT Image</td>\n        <td>GPT Image 1.5; GPT Image 2; GPT Image 2.5 Flare; GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>FLUX</td>\n        <td>FLUX.1 [dev]; FLUX.1 [schnell]; FLUX 1.1 [pro]; FLUX 1.1 [pro] ultra</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Seedream</td>\n        <td>Seedream 4; Seedream 4.5; Seedream 5 Lite; Seedream 5.0 Pro; Seedream 5.0 Pro Ultra</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n    <table>\n      <tbody><tr>\n        <th>Family</th>\n        <th>Models</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Seedance</td>\n        <td>Seedance 1.0 Lite †; Seedance 1.5 Pro; Seedance 2.0</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Kling</td>\n        <td>Kling 1.6 Pro; Kling 2.1 Pro †; Kling 2.1 Master †; Kling 2.5 Turbo Pro; Kling 2.6 Pro; Kling 3.0 Pro †; Kling 3.0 Standard †</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Veo</td>\n        <td>Veo 2 †; Veo 3 †; Veo 3 Fast; Veo 3.1; Veo 3.1 Fast; Veo 3.1 Lite</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Sora</td>\n        <td>Sora 2 †; Sora 2 Pro †</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Vidu</td>\n        <td>Vidu Q3; Vidu Q3 Turbo</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>MiniMax</td>\n        <td>MiniMax H3; MiniMax H3 Turbo ‡; MiniMax H3 Ultra ‡</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Flux</td>\n        <td>Flux 3; Flux 3 Draft</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n    <table>\n      <tbody><tr>\n        <th>Family</th>\n        <th>Models</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Suno</td>\n        <td>Suno Music; Suno Remix; Suno Sounds; Suno Sample</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Seed Audio</td>\n        <td>Seed Audio 1.0</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n    <table>\n      <tbody><tr>\n        <th>Family</th>\n        <th>Models</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Hunyuan 3D</td>\n        <td>Hunyuan 3D 2.0; Hunyuan 3D 2.1; Hunyuan 3D 3; Hunyuan 3D 3 Sketch; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Pro; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Rapid; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Part; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Smart Topology</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Tripo3D</td>\n        <td>Tripo3D H3.1</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Meshy</td>\n        <td>Meshy 6</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Rodin</td>\n        <td>Rodin 2.5 Fast</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n    <table>\n      <tbody><tr>\n        <th>Family</th>\n        <th>Models</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Marble</td>\n        <td>Marble 1.0; Marble 1.0 Draft; Marble 1.1; Marble 1.1 Plus</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>TripoSplat</td>\n        <td>TripoSplat</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n    <p>Additional provider integrations are planned for Kling, Google, Runway, and Luma. We're also interested in supporting existing subscriptions with aggregators such as OpenArt and Freepik.</p>\n    <p>ArtCraft is dual-licensed under <a href=\"/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/LICENSE-MIT\">MIT</a> or <a href=\"/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/LICENSE-APACHE\">Apache-2.0</a>, at your option.\nCopyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the ArtCraft contributors. Required notices, including\nthird-party material not covered by this license, are in <a href=\"/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/NOTICE\">NOTICE</a>.</p>\n  \n","markdown":"**The IDE for artists.**\n\n## artcraft-new-demo.mp4\n\n[Watch the two-minute ArtCraft demo on YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzvQMdg66Go)\n\n[Download ArtCraft](https://getartcraft.com/) ·\n  [GitHub releases](https://github.com/storytold/artcraft/releases) ·\n  [Build from source](/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/_docs/dev_setup.md)\n\nArtCraft is the IDE for interactive AI image and video creation. Compose in 2D, stage scenes in 3D, and choose the models that fit your work. Turn prompting into *crafting* with visual tools for precise, repeatable results.\n\nArtists need control over composition, character identity, and camera placement. Build the scene before you generate it. Click any preview to view it at full size.\n\n| Feature | Preview | \n|---|---|\n| **Image to Location** Place virtual actors in a consistent environment and plan multiple shots in the same room. |  | \n| **3D Image Compositing** Layer backdrops, foregrounds, and props in 3D to build compositions with depth. |  | \n| **2D Image Compositing** Compose a scene with image layers, background removal, and drawing tools. |  | \n| **Image to 3D Mesh** Turn an image into a 3D object you can position, rotate, and frame precisely. |  | \n| **Character Posing** Pose characters and set your camera before generating the final shot. |  | \n| **Scene Blocking with Kitbashing** Combine 3D asset kits to control camera angles, object placement, and depth. |  | \n| **Character Identity Transfer** Use a posed mannequin to guide the placement and pose of your character. |  | \n| **Background Removal** Isolate subjects to use as props, layers, or backdrops in 2D and 3D scenes. |  | \n| **Mixed Asset Crafting** Combine image cutouts, worlds, and 3D meshes in one scene. |  | \n\nMore previews are coming for scene blocking, canvas editing, and scene relighting.\n\nStart with a prompt when you want to explore an idea quickly, then use the canvas and scene tools to refine it.\n\n| Feature | Preview | \n|---|---|\n| **Text to Image** Explore ideas across a wide range of image models with a text prompt. |  | \n| **Prompted Image Editing** Describe changes to an image with models such as Nano Banana Pro and GPT Image. |  | \n| **Canvas Image Editing** Use drawing, masks, and inpainting to guide exactly where an image changes. |  | \n| **Image to Video** Animate an image with your choice of video models and generation controls. |  | \n\nMore previews are coming for image inpainting and image ingredients.\n\n| Provider | Models and workflows | \n|---|---|\n| **ArtCraft** | Images, video, music and sound, 3D meshes, and worlds. Browse the complete model catalog below. | \n| Grok | Grok Imagine and Grok Video. | \n| Midjourney | Midjourney image generation. | \n| Sora | Sora 1, Sora 2, and GPT Image 1. | \n| World Labs | Marble world generation with Gaussian splats. | \n\n## **ArtCraft: the full 62-model catalog**\n\n† Currently disabled. ‡ Restricted model; not currently available in the desktop app.\n\n| Family | Models | \n|---|---|\n| Nano Banana | Nano Banana; Nano Banana 2; Nano Banana Pro | \n| GPT Image | GPT Image 1.5; GPT Image 2; GPT Image 2.5 Flare; GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst | \n| FLUX | FLUX.1 \\[dev\\]; FLUX.1 \\[schnell\\]; FLUX 1.1 \\[pro\\]; FLUX 1.1 \\[pro\\] ultra | \n| Seedream | Seedream 4; Seedream 4.5; Seedream 5 Lite; Seedream 5.0 Pro; Seedream 5.0 Pro Ultra | \n\n| Family | Models | \n|---|---|\n| Seedance | Seedance 1.0 Lite †; Seedance 1.5 Pro; Seedance 2.0 | \n| Kling | Kling 1.6 Pro; Kling 2.1 Pro †; Kling 2.1 Master †; Kling 2.5 Turbo Pro; Kling 2.6 Pro; Kling 3.0 Pro †; Kling 3.0 Standard † | \n| Veo | Veo 2 †; Veo 3 †; Veo 3 Fast; Veo 3.1; Veo 3.1 Fast; Veo 3.1 Lite | \n| Sora | Sora 2 †; Sora 2 Pro † | \n| Vidu | Vidu Q3; Vidu Q3 Turbo | \n| MiniMax | MiniMax H3; MiniMax H3 Turbo ‡; MiniMax H3 Ultra ‡ | \n| Flux | Flux 3; Flux 3 Draft | \n\n| Family | Models | \n|---|---|\n| Suno | Suno Music; Suno Remix; Suno Sounds; Suno Sample | \n| Seed Audio | Seed Audio 1.0 | \n\n| Family | Models | \n|---|---|\n| Hunyuan 3D | Hunyuan 3D 2.0; Hunyuan 3D 2.1; Hunyuan 3D 3; Hunyuan 3D 3 Sketch; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Pro; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Rapid; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Part; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Smart Topology | \n| Tripo3D | Tripo3D H3.1 | \n| Meshy | Meshy 6 | \n| Rodin | Rodin 2.5 Fast | \n\n| Family | Models | \n|---|---|\n| Marble | Marble 1.0; Marble 1.0 Draft; Marble 1.1; Marble 1.1 Plus | \n| TripoSplat | TripoSplat | \n\nAdditional provider integrations are planned for Kling, Google, Runway, and Luma. We're also interested in supporting existing subscriptions with aggregators such as OpenArt and Freepik.\n\nArtCraft is dual-licensed under [MIT](/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/LICENSE-MIT) or [Apache-2.0](/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/LICENSE-APACHE), at your option.\nCopyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the ArtCraft contributors. Required notices, including\nthird-party material not covered by this license, are in [NOTICE](/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/NOTICE).","images":["https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/533582068-21f103e3-cc19-4882-a630-9caa1b76ae31.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzM1ODIwNjgtMjFmMTAzZTMtY2MxOS00ODgyLWE2MzAtOWNhYTFiNzZhZTMxLndlYnA_.ZE82eyCsmyeNJDgY6SQx-39esEDakB0wCFIPTsibc_k","https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/534173663-f93a616f-571d-474e-bcc0-53736de7303d.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzQxNzM2NjMtZjkzYTYxNmYtNTcxZC00NzRlLWJjYzAtNTM3MzZkZTczMDNkLndlYnA_.-sak8CD6GkcYpm2sBsxr-m4VPFgIxnv9Xew0sP9hmZw","https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/534174790-d6f99391-e496-4c62-9e37-29734ba5f899.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzQxNzQ3OTAtZDZmOTkzOTEtZTQ5Ni00YzYyLTllMzctMjk3MzRiYTVmODk5LndlYnA_.V9wed7XegzbkpxHzgzCxiEywfvCSeLqvZfSGyJukV3Q","https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/533587626-600a405c-e360-48c1-9b42-6e657ae6243b.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzM1ODc2MjYtNjAwYTQwNWMtZTM2MC00OGMxLTliNDItNmU2NTdhZTYyNDNiLndlYnA_.1c2J9J0cWi9q8cSsQXHGEk9aff-MObLa9H_CPHAgnnU","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/storytold/github-media/22a27373707b13f48fc56405f1f89ca143c43d5d/character-posing.webp","https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537505965-eef025ac-0346-4a46-a023-d48e23629eb5.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MDU5NjUtZWVmMDI1YWMtMDM0Ni00YTQ2LWEwMjMtZDQ4ZTIzNjI5ZWI1LndlYnA_.Cten-HZBTHWfZR_PpfR5yWuJprVloSHAUbyiZ8BXcxg","https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537511944-629119ee-8c76-4a83-9827-8c6c995a3ec1.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MTE5NDQtNjI5MTE5ZWUtOGM3Ni00YTgzLTk4MjctOGM2Yzk5NWEzZWMxLndlYnA_.HDJ_VcD1bJD2UCaUKe8T71FMI7Y_dTqCQQYUdA6Ejq8","https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537520656-90c65057-5531-404f-83af-b34e66e24ec1.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MjA2NTYtOTBjNjUwNTctNTUzMS00MDRmLTgzYWYtYjM0ZTY2ZTI0ZWMxLndlYnA_.RpHPSNtGMN0xopb4mQYhLUSHjJjAo44TF2IgFhNOjoQ"],"kind":"web","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T01:32:17.984683+00:00","title_zh":"artcraft,ArtCraft 是一个面向艺术家、设计师和电影制作人的有意制作引擎,下载artcraft的源码_GitHub_酷徒","html_zh":"<p>面向艺术家的 IDE。</p>\n<h3>artcraft-new-demo.mp4</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzvQMdg66Go\">在 YouTube 上观看两分钟的 ArtCraft 演示</a></p>\n<p>\n<img/>\n<img/>\n<img/>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://getartcraft.com/\">下载 ArtCraft</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/storytold/artcraft/releases\">GitHub 发布</a>·<a href=\"/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/_docs/dev_setup.md\">从源代码构建</a></p>\n<p>ArtCraft 是用于交互式 AI 图像和视频创建的 IDE。以 2D 进行创作，以 3D 进行舞台场景，并选择适合您的作品的模型。使用视觉工具将提示转变为手工，以获得精确、可重复的结果。</p>\n<p>艺术家需要控制构图、角色身份和摄像机位置。在生成场景之前构建场景。单击任意预览即可以完整尺寸查看。</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>预览</th>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>图像到位置<p>将虚拟演员放置在一致的环境中，并在同一个房间内计划多个镜头。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"Image to Location demo\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/533582068-21f103e3-cc19-4882-a630-9caa1b76ae31.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzM1ODIwNjgtMjFmMTAzZTMtY2MxOS00ODgyLWE2MzAtOWNhYTFiNzZhZTMxLndlYnA_.ZE82eyCsmyeNJDgY6SQx-39esEDakB0wCFIPTsibc_k\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>3D图像合成<p>以 3D 方式分层背景、前景和道具，构建具有深度的构图。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"3D Image Compositing demo\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/534173663-f93a616f-571d-474e-bcc0-53736de7303d.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzQxNzM2NjMtZjkzYTYxNmYtNTcxZC00NzRlLWJjYzAtNTM3MzZkZTczMDNkLndlYnA_.-sak8CD6GkcYpm2sBsxr-m4VPFgIxnv9Xew0sP9hmZw\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>2D 图像合成<p>使用图像图层、背景去除和绘图工具构建场景。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"2D Image Compositing demo\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/534174790-d6f99391-e496-4c62-9e37-29734ba5f899.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzQxNzQ3OTAtZDZmOTkzOTEtZTQ5Ni00YzYyLTllMzctMjk3MzRiYTVmODk5LndlYnA_.V9wed7XegzbkpxHzgzCxiEywfvCSeLqvZfSGyJukV3Q\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>图像到 3D 网格<p>将图像转换为可以精确定位、旋转和取景的 3D 对象。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"Image to 3D Mesh demo\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/533587626-600a405c-e360-48c1-9b42-6e657ae6243b.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81MzM1ODc2MjYtNjAwYTQwNWMtZTM2MC00OGMxLTliNDItNmU2NTdhZTYyNDNiLndlYnA_.1c2J9J0cWi9q8cSsQXHGEk9aff-MObLa9H_CPHAgnnU\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>人物造型<p>在生成最终镜头之前，摆好角色姿势并设置相机。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"Character Posing demo\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/storytold/github-media/22a27373707b13f48fc56405f1f89ca143c43d5d/character-posing.webp\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>使用 Kitbashing 进行场景遮挡<p>结合 3D 资源套件来控制摄像机角度、对象放置和深度。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"Scene Blocking with Kitbashing demo\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537505965-eef025ac-0346-4a46-a023-d48e23629eb5.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MDU5NjUtZWVmMDI1YWMtMDM0Ni00YTQ2LWEwMjMtZDQ4ZTIzNjI5ZWI1LndlYnA_.Cten-HZBTHWfZR_PpfR5yWuJprVloSHAUbyiZ8BXcxg\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>角色身份转移<p>使用摆好姿势的人体模型来指导角色的位置和姿势。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"Character Identity Transfer demo\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537511944-629119ee-8c76-4a83-9827-8c6c995a3ec1.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MTE5NDQtNjI5MTE5ZWUtOGM3Ni00YTgzLTk4MjctOGM2Yzk5NWEzZWMxLndlYnA_.HDJ_VcD1bJD2UCaUKe8T71FMI7Y_dTqCQQYUdA6Ejq8\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>背景去除<p>隔离主题以用作 2D 和 3D 场景中的道具、图层或背景。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"Background Removal demo\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537520656-90c65057-5531-404f-83af-b34e66e24ec1.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MjA2NTYtOTBjNjUwNTctNTUzMS00MDRmLTgzYWYtYjM0ZTY2ZTI0ZWMxLndlYnA_.RpHPSNtGMN0xopb4mQYhLUSHjJjAo44TF2IgFhNOjoQ\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>混合资产制作<p>将图像剪切、世界和 3D 网格合并到一个场景中。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"Mixed Asset Crafting demo\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/storytold/github-media/main/ship-editing.gif\"/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>即将推出更多场景阻挡、画布编辑和场景重新照明预览。</p>\n<p>当您想要快速探索一个想法时，请从提示开始，然后使用画布和场景工具对其进行完善。</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>预览</th>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>文字转图像<p>通过文本提示探索各种图像模型的想法。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"Text to Image demo\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537514969-9cc289cd-faf4-4eaf-aed2-21134cce127c.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MTQ5NjktOWNjMjg5Y2QtZmFmNC00ZWFmLWFlZDItMjExMzRjY2UxMjdjLndlYnA_.PTZrf2uKzJ20hwdCi9KpU4hyVnjcg1HBGOjXxGROic4\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>提示图像编辑<p>描述使用 Nano Banana Pro 和 GPT Image 等模型对图像的更改。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"Prompted Image Editing demo\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537518478-a06fa6ad-936c-42d0-8767-48fdbb8ff141.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MTg0NzgtYTA2ZmE2YWQtOTM2Yy00MmQwLTg3NjctNDhmZGJiOGZmMTQxLndlYnA_.dvDR_YOpT_sSkUMkmuZJA837QB2RbUVHqTtyEft9xjQ\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>画布图像编辑<p>使用绘图、蒙版和修复来准确指导图像发生变化的位置。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"Canvas Image Editing demo\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537516984-f036e08a-f3a6-417a-98ee-ec7f04b2b5ff.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MTY5ODQtZjAzNmUwOGEtZjNhNi00MTdhLTk4ZWUtZWM3ZjA0YjJiNWZmLndlYnA_.t2uXBC6RKbvG_qGbFRenkFMlco3Fi5TI4XXJIBwvqJg\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>图像转视频<p>使用您选择的视频模型和生成控件来制作图像动画。</p></td>\n<td><img alt=\"Image to Video demo\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/39263/537515742-2bc6c592-511e-4fba-b40f-03c96699b7f7.webp?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTI5Nzg2MzcsIm5iZiI6MTc5Mjk3ODMzNywicGF0aCI6Ii8zOTI2My81Mzc1MTU3NDItMmJjNmM1OTItNTExZS00ZmJhLWI0MGYtMDNjOTY2OTliN2Y3LndlYnA_.aFQtP81vEMhKk1y0vJlsQK9YNvy5tKdi7WE9h9hbGe8\"/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>更多图像修复和图像成分预览即将推出。</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>提供者</th>\n<th>模型和工作流程</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>艺术工艺</td>\n<td>图像、视频、音乐和声音、3D 网格和世界。浏览下面的完整型号目录。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格罗克</td>\n<td>Grok 想象和 Grok 视频。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中途</td>\n<td>中途图像生成。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索拉</td>\n<td>Sora 1、Sora 2 和 GPT 图像 1。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>世界实验室</td>\n<td>带有高斯斑点的大理石世界生成。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>ArtCraft：完整的 62 个模型目录</h3>\n<p>† 目前已禁用。 ‡ 受限型号；目前在桌面应用程序中不可用。</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>家庭</th>\n<th>型号</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纳米香蕉</td>\n<td>纳米香蕉；纳米香蕉2；纳米香蕉专业版</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT 图像</td>\n<td>GPT 图像 1.5； GPT 图像 2； GPT 图像 2.5 耀斑； GPT 图像 2.5 旭日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通量</td>\n<td>FLUX.1 [开发]; FLUX.1 [施内尔];通量 1.1 [专业版]； FLUX 1.1 [专业版] 超</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>种子梦</td>\n<td>种子梦4；种子梦4.5； Seedream 5 Lite； Seedream 5.0 专业版； Seedream 5.0 专业版</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>家庭</th>\n<th>型号</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>种子舞</td>\n<td>Seedance 1.0 Lite †； Seedance 1.5 专业版；种子之舞2.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>克林</td>\n<td>克林1.6专业版；克林 2.1 Pro †；克林 2.1 大师 †;克林 2.5 Turbo Pro；克林2.6专业版；克林 3.0 专业版 †；克林 3.0 标准 †</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>我懂了</td>\n<td>我看到 2 †；我看到 3 †；我看到3快；我看到3.1；我看到 3.1 快；我看到 3.1 Lite</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索拉</td>\n<td>姐妹 2 †;姐妹 2 Pro †</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>看</td>\n<td>维杜Q3；维杜Q3涡轮增压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小最大</td>\n<td>迷你最大 H3； MiniMax H3 Turbo ‡； MiniMax H3 Ultra ‡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通量</td>\n<td>助焊剂3；通量 3 草案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>家庭</th>\n<th>型号</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>太阳</td>\n<td>苏诺音乐；苏诺混音；苏诺声音；苏诺样品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>种子音频</td>\n<td>种子音频1.0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>家庭</th>\n<th>型号</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hunyuan 3D</td>\n<td>Hunyuan 3D 2.0; Hunyuan 3D 2.1; Hunyuan 3D 3; Hunyuan 3D 3 Sketch; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Pro; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Rapid; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Part; Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Smart Topology</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三维三维</td>\n<td>Tripo3D H3.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网状</td>\n<td>网状 6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>罗丹</td>\n<td>罗丹2.5快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>家庭</th>\n<th>型号</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大理石</td>\n<td>大理石1.0；大理石 1.0 草案；大理石 1.1；大理石 1.1 Plus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特里波斯普拉特</td>\n<td>特里波斯普拉特</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>计划为 Kling、Google、Runway 和 Luma 提供更多提供商集成。我们还有兴趣通过 OpenArt 和 Freepik 等聚合器支持现有订阅。</p>\n<p>ArtCraft 获得<a href=\"/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/LICENSE-MIT\">MIT</a>或<a href=\"/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/LICENSE-APACHE\">Apache-2.0</a>的双重许可，由您选择。版权所有 (c) 2026 ArtCraft 团队和 ArtCraft 贡献者。所需的通知，包括本许可证未涵盖的第三方材料，请参见<a href=\"/storytold/artcraft/blob/main/NOTICE\">“通知”</a> 。</p>\n","translated_at":"2026-10-26T01:32:44Z","summary_zh":"ArtCraft 是面向艺术家的开源 AI 图像和视频创作 IDE。用户可以在 2D 中合成画面，在 3D 中布置场景、角色和镜头，再选择合适的模型生成，以获得精确、可重复的结果。功能包括把虚拟演员放进一致的场景并规划多个镜头、3D 分层合成前景背景和道具，以及带抠图和绘制工具的 2D 合成。项目提供桌面版下载和源码构建说明。"}